\page cmdConvert Convert Tracks

A drop down menu, which allows selection of the Convert Mode, is invoked from the down arrow button (![](bmenu.png)) located on the right side the Convert Tracks button.
Dependent upon previous selection, the Convert Track button will look like ![](convertto.png) or ![](convertfrom.png).

- \subpage cmdConvertTo
